{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55548","headline":"偈 十六 · 契此","name":"偈 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白屋安贫终暂计，夕阳归路岂知还？\n莲花佛国深深处，出世芳踪不可攀。\n（《奉化县补义志》卷三。\n）（按：《明州岳林寺志》六卷，奉化戴明琮撰成於康熙二十六年。\n《奉化县补义志》十卷，民国元年蒋尧裳撰。\n二书均藏於奉化县文物室，承张靖龙同志录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"契此","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55548.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55548","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}